<Base title="About Ivan" description="35 years fixing problems solo. Now testing AI tools for solo business owners.">
  <h1>Hi, I’m Ivan.</h1>
  <p class="lead">For 35 years I ran a one-man business fixing computers in people’s homes.</p>
  <p>I learned two things. Problems keep coming back when people don’t understand why they happened, so I always explained the why. And finding clients is harder than doing the work. I faced that second problem alone for years.</p>
  <p>Today, AI tools can take much of that weight off a solo owner. I test them myself, on real projects, and I tell you straight whether each one is worth your time and how to make it fit the way you work.</p>
  <h2>What you can expect</h2>
  <p>Honest opinions, including when a tool isn’t good. Clear explanations without jargon. A verdict at the end of every review, so you know if it’s for you.</p>
  <p class="note">Some links here are affiliate links. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Read how I handle them</a>.</p>
</Base>
